  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mkondezi Rice Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture, rice production and processing. , Beneficiaries: 121 cooperative members, of which 83 are women. , Project Description: Mkondezi Rice Producers is a registered cooperative of smallholder farmers that grow rice in the Nkhata Bay district in northern Malawi. Their main objective is to improve livelihoods of members.The cooperative has a warehouse, a milling house and 2 mills. The cooperative produces and sells its rice locally due to lack of reliable markets. The cooperative is seeking USADF assistance to build up its capacity to manage the cooperative, to accelerate production and to increase incomes.</narrative>
  </description>
